# T-Bank all methods ← Alfa SBP discipline (K-TBANK-FROM-ALFA-SBP-001)

Port the **process / ship laws** proven on Alfa SBP (`alfa-sbp-pass-0433`, `alfa-sbp-3a-neg`, Oracle emit gates) onto every T-Bank channel. Adapt them to **Jasper / OpenPDF T-Bank receipts** — never paste Alfa Oracle layout, Producer, FO CID, or LEFT `35.45`/`304.75` onto T-Bank.

